ce_after_ply":9,"anchor_node_id":"0:9","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"红方虽解除了黑车对拐脚马的威胁，但也付出了七路马进退失先的代价。||现在黑方冲卒急躁，应改走卒7进1或马2进1稳住阵脚，再图进取。","text":"红方虽解除了黑车对拐脚马的威胁，但也付出了七路马进退失先的代价。\n现在黑方冲卒急躁，应改走卒7进1或马2进1稳住阵脚，再图进取。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"吃卒可兑去黑3路恶炮并获多兵之利。","text":"吃卒可兑去黑3路恶炮并获多兵之利。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment26","raw_text":"漏着！","text":"漏着！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"0:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment27","raw_text":"直接兑炮也未细看，否则先炮三进四打车捉象，红方大优。","text":"直接兑炮也未细看，否则先炮三进四打车捉象，红方大优。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"0:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment29","raw_text":"好棋！攻击黑方的弱马。","text":"好棋！攻击黑方的弱马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"0:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"至此红方净多三兵，后防稳固，只要顶住黑方的冲击，胜利可待。","text":"至此红方净多三兵，后防稳固，只要顶住黑方的冲击，胜利可待。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment36:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment36","raw_text":"黑方只好先将子力切入红阵，以待机会。","text":"黑方只好先将子力切入红阵，以待机会。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":36,"anchor_node_id":"0:36","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"补士虽能固防，但却没有抓住局面的关键之处。应改走兵三进一下步炮三进一驱逐黑马、或者车九平八下步炮八平七，黑方都将无处发力，纠缠之中红方多兵自然便宜。","text":"补士虽能固防，但却没有抓住局面的关键之处。应改走兵三进一下步炮三进一驱逐黑马、或者车九平八下步炮八平七，黑方都将无处发力，纠缠之中红方多兵自然便宜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment38:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment38","raw_text":"平车竭力寻求战机，也有诱使红方打象分散子力之意。","text":"平车竭力寻求战机，也有诱使红方打象分散子力之意。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":38,"anchor_node_id":"0:38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment39:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment39","raw_text":"打象失策！导致子力分散，局面失去控制。仍可走车九平八而占优。","text":"打象失策！导致子力分散，局面失去控制。仍可走车九平八而占优。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":39,"anchor_node_id":"0:39","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment42:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment42","raw_text":"好棋！可以切断红方两翼的联系。","text":"好棋！可以切断红方两翼的联系。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":42,"anchor_node_id":"0:42","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment46:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment46","raw_text":"至此，红方虽然多兵多象，但黑方大子活跃，攻势一触即发！红方并不乐观。","text":"至此，红方虽然多兵多象，但黑方大子活跃，攻势一触即发！红方并不乐观。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":46,"anchor_node_id":"0:46","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment48:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment48","raw_text":"平车刁钻！伏车3进2撕开红防线的凶狠手段。","text":"平车刁钻！伏车3进2撕开红防线的凶狠手段。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":48,"anchor_node_id":"0:48","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment49","raw_text":"红试图围魏救赵，用车炮的攻势牵制黑方。","text":"红试图围魏救赵，用车炮的攻势牵制黑方。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"0:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment50:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment50","raw_text":"撑士稳健，也可车7平6，车三进一，将5平6，伏车3平5砍中相，也是黑优。","text":"撑士稳健，也可车7平6，车三进一，将5平6，伏车3平5砍中相，也是黑优。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":50,"anchor_node_id":"0:50","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment52:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment52","raw_text":"弃马撕开红棋防线，着法锋利！","text":"弃马撕开红棋防线，着法锋利！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":52,"anchor_node_id":"0:52","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment57:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment57","raw_text":"吃士防守速败，应士六进五，黑如车3平5，则帅五平六，尚有变化。","text":"吃士防守速败，应士六进五，黑如车3平5，则帅五平六，尚有变化。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":57,"anchor_node_id":"0:57","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment60:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment60","raw_text":"好棋！","text":"好棋！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":60,"anchor_node_id":"0:60","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment61:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment61","raw_text":"无奈，如车八平六，车5进1大胆穿心妙杀！","text":"无奈，如车八平六，车5进1大胆穿心妙杀！","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":61,"anchor_node_id":"0:61","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment62:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment62","raw_text":"至此黑方胜定。","text":"至此黑方胜定。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":62,"anchor_node_id":"0:62","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment66:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment66","raw_text":"黑胜||||黑方再次施展大胆穿心的杀着，红已无力防守。","text":"黑胜\n\n黑方再次施展大胆穿心的杀着，红已无力防守。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":66,"anchor_node_id":"0:66","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["张锦荣 先负 雷海山"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":28,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":66,"legal_move_records":66,"annotations":24,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":24}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-59","category_id":"59","title":"第三部分 各地名手实战对局 张锦荣 负 雷海山","catalogue_order":262,